From e08a9adbec92d430b0346aa781fef04edab78445 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 23:51:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] virtual-media: list images on SMB and NFS shares

Add a legacy D-Bus method that mounts a share read-only and returns supported top-level image files. Decode URI path components for selected filenames, retain credentials in the existing pipe flow, and reject NFS credentials.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Till Heinzerling <1684934+hoinzy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
